<title>USA: Innovir Laboratories Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Innovir Laboratories Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.14     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 2,500     loss	   600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,000		    9,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Innovir Laboratories Inc said the net loss for the first quarter of 1996 reflects the operations of the former VIMRX Pharmaceuticals Inc subsidiary, VIMRX Holdings Ltd, which was acquired in a reverse acquisition.  The net loss for the first quarter of 1997 reflects the operations of the combined company.</p>
</text>
